Ohle Claussen wrote:
> On 2006-12-13, sjdevnull@yahoo.com wrote:
>> Nathan wrote:
>>> sjdevnull@yahoo.com wrote:
>>>> ditch the gems/gold/trophy weapons, they only weigh you down
